
; Start_of story

; create the variables
@char Yuni
@hideChars

@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

All events in this game are entirely fictional.
For now.

;hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand



; play fade in computer screen sound
@sfx Pc_Welcome_sfx

; show welcome screen
@showUI WelcomeScreen

; wait for 5 seconds
@wait 5


; show dialogue box
@showPrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

Yuni: Ugh, my head. Scilla sure knows how to drink.
Yuni: Shame she isn’t taking apprentices.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand


; Fade in to desktop, SFX humming computer on the background ON LOOP
@showUI Desktop
@hideUI WelcomeScreen

@sfx Pc_humming_sfx loop!

@wait 0.5


; show dialogue box
@showPrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

Yuni: Alright, let’s see what horrors awoke while I was out.

@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand


;;;; SALVA VERITATE SECTION ;;;

; web browser is already open on desktop
@onOpenWebCommand
@onOpenNewsCommand




@stop